    {
      "source": "Note: Cassandra supports single-field <code>IN</code> queries only. When using <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> with multiple components,\nuse <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/CrudRepository.html#findById(ID)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository.findById(Object)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注意：Cassandra 仅支持单字段的 <code>IN</code> 查询。当使用包含多个组件的 <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> 时，请使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/CrudRepository.html#findById(ID)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository.findById(Object)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Repositories based on <a href=\"CassandraRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository\"><code>CassandraRepository</code></a> can define either a single primary key, use a primary key class or\na compound primary key without a primary key class. Types using a compound primary key without a primary key class\nmust use <a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> to declare their key value.",
      "translation": "基于<a href=\"CassandraRepository.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository 中的接口\"><code>CassandraRepository</code></a>的存储库可以定义单个主键、使用主键类，或使用不带主键类的复合主键。对于使用不带主键类的复合主键的类型，必须使用<a href=\"../core/mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MapId</code></a>来声明其键值。",
      "count": 1
    },
