    {
      "source": "Inserts the given entities. Assumes the given entities to have not been persisted yet and thus will optimize the\ninsert over a call to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/ListCrudRepository.html#saveAll(java.lang.Iterable)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>ListCrudRepository.saveAll(Iterable)</code></a>. Prefer using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/ListCrudRepository.html#saveAll(java.lang.Iterable)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>ListCrudRepository.saveAll(Iterable)</code></a> to avoid the usage of\nstore specific API.",
      "translation": "插入给定的实体。假定这些实体尚未持久化，因此将优化对<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/ListCrudRepository.html#saveAll(java.lang.Iterable)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>ListCrudRepository.saveAll(Iterable)</code></a>的调用。为避免使用特定于存储层的 API，建议使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/ListCrudRepository.html#saveAll(java.lang.Iterable)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>ListCrudRepository.saveAll(Iterable)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
